{#
  Deliberately MINIMAL (§15 of the conventions): it says a request arrived and
  links to the secured page. No renter name, email, phone or comment — an
  inbox is not a place to scatter copies of personal data, and a manager who
  needs the detail is one click from the page that shows it behind a real
  permission check. That is also why `renter_name` is not declared here
  while it is declared on the e-mails the renter receives.
#}
{% extends 'email/base.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;color:#212529;">Nouvelle demande de location</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour,</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Une nouvelle demande de location vient d'arriver.</p>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Bien : <strong>{{ asset_name }}</strong></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:4px;">Référence : <strong>{{ reference }}</strong></li>
        <li>Dates : du {{ arrival_date }} au {{ departure_date }}</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin:24px 0;text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{ manage_url }}"
           style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;background-color:#0d6efd;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">
            Traiter la demande
        </a>
    </p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#6c757d;">
        Les coordonnées du demandeur sont sur la page de la demande, jamais dans cet email.
    </p>
{% endblock %}
